package is Crown copyright.

The Crown makes that information available for use under the Open
Government Licence v3.0, which is the UK public sector's standard
free-to-use licence:

https://www.nationalarchives.gov.uk/doc/open-government-licence/version/3/

A copy is in LICENSES/OGL-UK-3.0.txt.

Crown copyright remains with the Crown. Re-using the information under
OGL does not transfer ownership. It does not grant official status or
